ghted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Share information about your brand with your customers. Describe a product, make announcements, or welcome customers to your store.<\/p>","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_font":"body","secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["image","heading","text"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"image_height":"600px","image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"400px","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"#171717","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"#fafafa","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"product-details":{"type":"product-details","blocks":{"collapsible_tab-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"icon":"none","icon_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Initials_middle_Black.jpg","icon_width":20,"heading":"Lion's Mane","content":"<p>Lion’s Mane Mushroom is your ally for long-term brain health and mental clarity. By promoting neurogenesis, it helps create and repair brain cells, empowering you to stay sharp and focused during physically and mentally demanding tasks. Whether you're pushing through an intense workout or strategizing your next move, Lion’s Mane supports cognitive resilience so you can perform at your best today and build a sharper mind for tomorrow.<em> [<\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/articles\/PMC10675414\/\" title=\"https:\/\/pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/articles\/PMC10675414\/\"><em>Study 1<\/em><\/a><em>] [<\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/articles\/PMC5987239\/\" title=\"https:\/\/pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/articles\/PMC5987239\/\"><em>2<\/em><\/a><em>]<\/em><\/p>","metafields":""}},"collapsible_tab-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"icon":"none","icon_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Initials_middle_Black.jpg","icon_width":20,"heading":"Alpha-GPC","content":"<p>Alpha-GPC is the key to unlocking the connection between your mind and body. As a premium source of choline, it optimizes brain function, enhances focus, and boosts mental processing speed. It doesn’t stop there—it strengthens communication between your brain and muscles, helping you achieve peak physical coordination and control when it matters most. Alpha-GPC ensures your mind and body work as one to maximize performance. <em>[<\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/articles\/PMC8235064\/\" title=\"https:\/\/pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/articles\/PMC8235064\/\"><em>Study 1<\/em><\/a><em>] [<\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/16971751\/\" title=\"https:\/\/pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/16971751\/\"><em>2<\/em><\/a><em>]<\/em><\/p>","metafields":""}},"collapsible_tab-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"icon":"none","icon_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Initials_middle_Black.jpg","icon_width":20,"heading":"Mucuna Pruriens","content":"<p>Fuel your drive with Mucuna Pruriens, a natural dopamine booster that elevates your mood, motivation, and mental energy. By supporting your brain’s reward system, it keeps you focused, energized, and resilient in the face of both physical and mental challenges. Whether you're competing, training, or staying sharp during a long day, Mucuna Pruriens gives you the mental edge to keep pushing forward. <em>[<\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/www.frontiersin.org\/journals\/physiology\/articles\/10.3389\/fphys.2023.1092032\/full\" title=\"https:\/\/www.frontiersin.org\/journals\/physiology\/articles\/10.3389\/fphys.2023.1092032\/full\"><em>Study 1<\/em><\/a><em>] [<\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/articles\/PMC8770455\/\" title=\"https:\/\/pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/articles\/PMC8770455\/\"><em>2<\/em><\/a><em>]<\/em><\/p>","metafields":""}},"collapsible_tab-4":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"icon":"none","icon_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Initials_middle_Black.jpg","icon_width":20,"heading":"BioPerine ®","content":"<p>BioPerine ensures you get the most out of every ingredient in the IntentFit Nootropic. By enhancing nutrient absorption and metabolism, it amplifies the effectiveness of the formula, delivering sustained energy and results you can feel. Beyond that, its anti-inflammatory properties help keep your body ready to perform at its best, no matter how intense the challenge. <em>[<\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/articles\/PMC7353321\/\" title=\"https:\/\/pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/articles\/PMC7353321\/\"><em>Study<\/em><\/a><em>] <\/em><\/p>","metafields":""}},"collapsible_tab_TFVNmf":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"icon":"none","icon_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Initials_middle_Black.jpg","icon_width":20,"heading":"Benefits","content":"<h6><strong>   Clear, Deliberate Focus <\/strong><\/h6><p>Backed by neuroscience, this formula enhances acetylcholine production—the neurotransmitter responsible for attention, learning, and cognitive endurance. Stay locked in, eliminate distractions, and maintain peak mental clarity during intense training and competition.<\/p><h6><strong>   Strengthened Mind-Body Connection<\/strong><\/h6><p>Optimized neuromuscular communication enhances motor control, reaction speed, and movement efficiency. By strengthening the pathways between your brain and muscles, you unlock greater coordination, precision, and power output in every movement.<\/p><h6><strong>   Sustained Energy<\/strong><\/h6><p>Formulated to support dopaminergic and cholinergic pathways, this nootropic delivers smooth, sustained energy without crashes keeping you mentally sharp and physically ready from start to finish. No overstimulation. No burnout. Just pure, controlled performance.<\/p><p><strong>Elevated Motivation<\/strong> <\/p><p>Leveraging L-Dopa from Mucuna Pruriens, this formula fuels the brain’s natural dopamine production, the neurotransmitter responsible for motivation, reward response, and mental resilience. Push past limits, train with purpose, and tap into an elite mindset.<\/p><h6><strong>Boosted Memory and Learning <\/strong><\/h6><p>Neuroplasticity-enhancing ingredients, including Lion’s Mane Mushroom, promote nerve growth factor (NGF) production, accelerating learning, muscle memory, and adaptation to new techniques. Master movements faster, refine your craft, and outperform the competition.<br\/><br\/><strong>Neurogenesis & Long-Term Cognitive Health<\/strong><\/p><p>Clinically backed to support brain cell regeneration and long-term cognitive resilience, this formula enhances BDNF (Brain-Derived Neurotrophic Factor)—a key driver of neurogenesis. Strengthen memory, sustain mental agility, and future-proof your brain against cognitive decline.<\/p>","metafields":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_tab-1","collapsible_tab-2","collapsible_tab-3","collapsible_tab-4","collapsible_tab_TFVNmf"],"settings":{"style":"with-border","open_first_row":true,"specifications_heading":"","heading":"Ingredients","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"#000000","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":28,"padding_bottom":28,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false}},"faq":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"question-1":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>What makes the Performance Nootropic different from other supplements?<\/strong>","text":"<ul><li>The Performance Nootropic is uniquely designed to bridge the mind-body connection, enhancing both mental clarity and physical performance. With clean, ingredients like Lion’s Mane for neurogenesis and Alpha-GPC for focus and coordination, it’s more than a supplement, it’s a tool for unlocking your full potential in both fitness and life.<\/li><\/ul>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question-2":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Who should use the Performance Nootropic?<\/strong>","text":"<ul><li>Whether you’re an athlete aiming for peak performance, a professional seeking sustained focus, or someone looking to improve motivation and memory, the <strong>Performance Nootropic <\/strong>is built for anyone committed to living intentionally and achieving their goals.<\/li><\/ul>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question-3":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>How and when should I take this supplement?<\/strong>","text":"<ul><li>Take 1-2 capsules 30 minutes before physical activity, mentally demanding tasks, or any situation where you need enhanced focus and energy. For best results, use consistently as part of your daily routine.<\/li><\/ul>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question-4":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Will the Performance Nootropic give me jitters or cause a crash?<\/strong>","text":"<ul><li>Not at all. The <strong>Performance Nootropic<\/strong> is formulated with natural, jitter-free ingredients like Mucuna Pruriens and BioPerine, providing clean, sustained energy without the spikes and crashes of traditional stimulants.<\/li><\/ul>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question-5":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Is the Intent Fit Nootropic safe, and what are the ingredients?<\/strong>","text":"<ul><li>Yes, the supplement is made with clean, science-backed ingredients including Lion’s Mane Mushroom, Alpha-GPC, Mucuna Pruriens, and BioPerine®. It’s free from artificial additives, fillers, and unnecessary chemicals, ensuring a safe and effective experience for optimizing your mind and body.<\/li><\/ul>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"contact":{"type":"contact","settings":{"heading":"Didn’t find your answer?","text":"<p>Don't hestitate to contact us<\/p>","show_phone":false,"avatar_height":60,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["question-1","question-2","question-3","question-4","question-5","contact"],"settings":{"style":"with-background","heading":"FAQs","heading_size":"title-lg tracking-heading","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"<p>Please read our <a href=\"#\" title=\"FAQ's\">FAQs<\/a> page to find out more.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"#ffffff","color_background":"#171717","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"#171717","color_button_background":"#ffffff","color_button_gradient":"","color_overlay":"#ffffff","overlay_opacity":4,"padding_top":84,"padding_bottom":84,"divider":false,"narrow":false,"rounded":false}},"product-recommendations":{"type":"product-recommendations","settings":{"product_limit":6,"columns":4,"carousel_on_desktop":true,"columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":true,"heading":"You may also like","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider